## 3. Target Audience & Searcher Profile

This article targets first-time renters, typically 22-30 years old, who are moving out of a family home, college dorm, or a shared roommate situation into their first solo or semi-solo apartment. They are in the active preparation stage of the renter journey: they have signed or are close to signing a lease, and they are now building a purchase and logistics plan. Their specific problem is feeling overwhelmed by not knowing what they need, in what order, and which items are true essentials versus nice-to-haves. Based on the SERP analysis, they expect a scannable, organized checklist they can save, screenshot, or refer back to during shopping, not a long-form essay.

