### Additional Production Rules

**Target word count:** 1,300-1,500 words of prose (excluding checklist bullets). Total page length including bullets will be approximately 1,800-2,200 words.

**Tone:** Knowledgeable friend giving practical advice. Not academic, not promotional, not listicle-style filler.

**Sentence structure:** Short declarative sentences. Two short sentences over one compound sentence. Avoid subordinate clauses that delay the main point.

**Paragraph length:** 2-4 sentences maximum. Dense paragraphs lose mobile readers and reduce dwell time.

